---
title: Orchestra — how one run flows
---
flowchart TB
    T([Trigger]) --> BB["build_brief<br/>fetch all data once, share it with everyone"]
    BB --> PA
    subgraph PA["parallel_analysis — 3 specialists at the same time"]
        direction LR
        IM["Inventory Monitor<br/>finds stockout risks"]
        SS["Supplier Scout<br/>finds price spikes &amp; unavailable suppliers"]
        IA["Invoice Auditor<br/>finds duplicate invoices"]
    end
    PA --> OR["orchestrate<br/>group findings by item, resolve clashes, decide"]
    OR --> EX["execute<br/>PO Manager places the approved orders"]
    EX --> AU["audit<br/>Decision Logger writes the record"]
    AU --> Z([done])
    OR -. "anything needing a human" .-> Q[("/api/approvals queue")]
